 archivebox/core/tag_util.py   |  34 ++-
 archivebox/core/user_scope.py | 427 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 517 insertions(+), 14 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 archivebox/core/user_scope.py

